flowchart TD
    S([Start: user opens Masari]) --> G["Greeting and disclosure:<br/>I am an AI guide.<br/>I use verified information from the Baccalaureate decrees.<br/>I give suggestions, not decisions, and I do not predict ability or success.<br/>The final decision is yours and your family's.<br/>Please do not type personal details. Typed questions are sent to an AI service.<br/>You can skip, go back, or leave at any time.<br/>Arabic is the default. English is available at any time"]
    G --> R{"Who is using Masari?<br/>(optional, changes wording and examples only)"}
    R -->|Student| H
    R -->|Parent| H
    R -->|School counselor| H
    R -->|Skip| H

    H[["HUB - Quick replies:<br/>Understand the system / Explore pathways / Take the interest check-in / Ask a question / What can you do? / Finish"]]

    H -->|Understand the system| U["Understand: short cards with source and date.<br/>Unverified details are flagged"]
    U -->|Back to hub| H
    U -->|Ask a question| B[["Subflow B: Guide Q and A"]]

    H -->|Explore pathways| E["Pathway cards for the 4 pathways<br/>(Pathway 1 to 4: names [VERIFY] with the official source)"]
    E -->|Select 2 or 3| C["Compare on the same criteria.<br/>No pathway is labeled better"]
    E -->|Back to hub| H
    C -->|Ask about differences| B
    C -->|Back to hub| H

    H -->|Take the interest check-in| A[["Subflow A: Assessment"]]
    A -->|Questions done and scoring succeeded| SUG
    A -->|Stopped early| H
    A -->|Technical error| ERR

    SUG["Suggestions: up to 3 pathways worth exploring.<br/>Fit bands, matched factors, mismatches, uncertainty.<br/>Banner: suggestions, not decisions.<br/>Low-accuracy notice if most answers were skipped"]
    SUG --> QRS[["Quick replies:<br/>Why this? / Change my answers / Change factor importance / Compare pathways / Simple wording / Write a note / This does not fit me / Back to hub"]]

    QRS -->|Why this?| W["Reasons panel: the factors actually used by the scoring rules"]
    W --> QRS
    QRS -->|Change my answers| ED[/"User edits an answer or the importance of a factor"/]
    QRS -->|Change factor importance| ED
    ED --> RS["Re-run the rule-based scoring and show updated suggestions"]
    RS -->|Success| SUG
    RS -->|Backend error| ERR
    QRS -->|Compare pathways| C
    QRS -->|Simple wording| SW["Plain-language rewrite of the current explanation"]
    SW -->|Success| QRS
    SW -->|Model error| ERR
    QRS -->|Write a note| N[/"User writes a note, kept for this session only"/]
    N --> QRS
    QRS -->|This does not fit me| FB["Optional reason: tap a reason or write a few words.<br/>Logged anonymously. Thank the user"]
    FB --> QRS
    QRS -->|Back to hub| H

    H -->|Ask a question| B
    B -->|Back to hub| H
    B -->|Technical error| ERR
    H -->|What can you do?| CAN["Repeat what Masari can and cannot do"]
    CAN --> H
    H -->|Finish| FIN(["Closing message: the final decision stays with you and your family. Session ends"])

    ERR[["Subflow C: Technical error recovery"]]
    ERR -->|Recovered| RTN(["Return to the step where the error happened"])
    ERR -->|Continue without the chat guide| H
    ERR -->|Connection not restored: leave| FIN
